    "type": "question",
    "label": "7",
    "prompt": "Phoenix Finance Pty Ltd recently issued bonus shares that increased by $14\\%$ the number of shares held by each of the company’s shareholders. By dividing by $114\\%=1.14$, find the original holding of a shareholder who now holds the following, giving answers to the nearest whole share:",
